    "description": "If at least one enemy within your line of sight is aware of you and you do not have <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> against that enemy, at the start of your turn if you are conscious you gain a number of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> equal to 5 + one-half your Heroic Level. Damage is subtracted from <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> first, and any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> remaining at the end of the encounter are lost. <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> do not stack.",
